  "notes": [
    "This is the first geometric scale test of the admitted context mechanism. Early absolute reward remains proxy evidence; continuation slopes, cross-seed replication, holdout breadth, seats, and Standard10 preservation jointly determine further scale.",
    "Primary run completed all 20,736 training and 27,648 evaluation hands, then failed only in a seat-summary schema lookup. Aggregate recovery restored outcome/preservation metrics but exposed omitted per-step geometry. This exact replay uses the same saved hand identities and adds zero new independent environment hands.",
    "All primary environment work completed before a postprocessing-only seat-schema error. Aggregate recovery used existing artifacts only. Exact replay then regenerated the identical saved trajectories/schedules and reproduced every checkpoint tensor, restoring the omitted per-step geometry without adding independent environment hands.",
    "All three pooled slopes were positive and final holdout/seat medians were positive, but seed1 final holdout (-29.232) and correct-vs-wrong context value (-10.16) were negative. Admission is therefore to one monitored geometric continuation, not evidence of uniform OOD improvement."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "Three continuous posterior-context seeds completed 20,736 training and 27,648 evaluation hands. From 128 to 512 learning hands/group, pooled slopes were +11.874, +19.192, and +10.855 bb/100; final deltas were +3.902, +16.414, +10.247. Final holdout median was +11.263 and seat median +9.683. Exact replay verified all six trajectories, schedules, checkpoints, optimizer states, and 384/384 positive-geometry updates.",
    "conclusion": "The reliability-shrunk posterior-context method now has a reproducible positive geometric learning slope, multi-seed breadth medians, strong Standard10 preservation, and exact training provenance. One seed exhibits severe holdout tradeoff, so the next 4x continuation must keep per-seed holdout and context-value gates rather than relying only on pooled performance.",
    "decision": "ADMIT_POSTERIOR_CONTEXT_512_TO_2048_MONITORED_SCALE",
    "next_step": "Resume the three exact endpoint512 checkpoints, optimizers, and group counts to 2,048 learning hands/group without replaying prior hands. Save geometry in each new checkpoint, evaluate on larger fresh broad common-deck cohorts, and require at least two positive slopes plus at least two nonnegative final holdout seeds before any further scale or Slumbot gate."
  },
